THE FULLEST PLAN (7 units). The unit you write REPLACES its final unit, closing this arc:

U1: What Kind of Questions Do Scientists Ask?
U2: Science Is Everywhere — A Textbook Tour
U3: Ideas That Changed — Reading the Shift
U4: The Values That Drive Scientific Change
U5: The Engine of Change — Building a Causal Account
U6: Is This Science? Evaluating Real Scenarios
